      "id": 489868,
      "username": "RocketQuack",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-12-30T18:26:24.158Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It may be that these are still displayed because roles are still directed to the DOcTypes. If you adjust the roles accordingly to which modules users should only be allowed to access, they should disappear from the workspace view.</p>\n<p>If you want to retain the rights but hide the modules for viewing only, edit the workspace</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/0/c05941fb3e6c396fcff1408dec2dec6a890f225f.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"rrAUiW3PGmezpC6ZGUsB9mrb8Zx\" width=\"204\" height=\"76\"><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20cf7a922a4f97775a9e0c56019215f92e036aff.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/20cf7a922a4f97775a9e0c56019215f92e036aff\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20cf7a922a4f97775a9e0c56019215f92e036aff.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"4GfNCq9nug0BkOecsKfePAd408v\" width=\"249\" height=\"184\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">249×184 8.28 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
